      <title>C 语言洛谷刷题笔记</title>
      <link href="/posts/438dd0b4.html"/>
      <url>/posts/438dd0b4.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>从 <code>P1001 A+B</code> 一路刷到 <code>P5710</code>，把所有踩过的坑和学到的知识点整理在这。<br>遇到不会的，先翻这份笔记。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="目录">目录</h2><ul><li><a href="#%E4%B8%80c-%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E9%AA%A8%E6%9E%B6">一、C 程序的基本骨架</a></li><li><a href="#%E4%BA%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA-scanf--printf">二、输入输出 scanf / printf</a></li><li><a href="#%E4%B8%89%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%8E%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E7%AC%A6%E5%AF%B9%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8">三、数据类型与格式符对照表</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83">四、变量与命名规范</a></li><li><a href="#%E4%BA%94%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E9%99%B7%E9%98%B1">五、运算陷阱</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%85%AD%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E7%AC%A6">六、逻辑运算符</a></li><li><a href="#%E4%B8%83%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0">七、常见数学函数</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%85%AB%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80">八、字符串基础</a></li><li><a href="#%E4%B9%9D%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E9%A3%8E%E6%A0%BC">九、代码风格</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%8D%81%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%92%E9%94%99">十、调试与排错</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%E6%B4%9B%E8%B0%B7%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89">十一、洛谷报错含义</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E5%88%B7%E9%A2%98%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95">十二、刷题清单</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%89%E8%B8%A9%E8%BF%87%E7%9A%84%E5%9D%91%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5">十三、踩过的坑速查</a></li></ul><hr><h2 id="一、C-程序的基本骨架">一、C 程序的基本骨架</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 你的代码</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>要点</strong></p><ul><li><code>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</code> 用 <code>scanf</code> / <code>printf</code> 必须有</li><li><code>main</code> 是程序入口</li><li><code>return 0;</code> 表示程序正常结束（不写也能过，但养成习惯）</li></ul><hr><h2 id="二、输入输出-scanf-printf">二、输入输出 scanf / printf</h2><h3 id="核心规则">核心规则</h3><blockquote><p><strong><code>scanf</code> 要地址（<code>&amp;</code>），<code>printf</code> 要值（不用 <code>&amp;</code>）。</strong></p></blockquote><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> x;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, &amp;x);      <span class="comment">// ✅ 要 &amp;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, x);      <span class="comment">// ✅ 不要 &amp;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>为什么？</strong></p><ul><li><code>scanf</code> 要<strong>往变量里写数据</strong>，必须知道变量在哪 → 给<strong>地址</strong>（<code>&amp;x</code>）</li><li><code>printf</code> 只是<strong>读变量的值</strong> → 给<strong>值</strong>（<code>x</code>）</li></ul><p><strong>漏掉 <code>&amp;</code> 的后果：程序崩溃 → RE</strong>（踩过两次）</p><h3 id="数组是例外">数组是例外</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">char</span> s[<span class="number">100</span>];</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%s&quot;</span>, s);       <span class="comment">// ⚠️ 数组名本身就是地址，不要加 &amp;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="三、数据类型与格式符对照表">三、数据类型与格式符对照表</h2><h3 id="⭐-必背表">⭐ 必背表</h3><table><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th><code>scanf</code></th><th><code>printf</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>int</code></td><td><code>%d</code></td><td><code>%d</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>long long</code></td><td><code>%lld</code></td><td><code>%lld</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>float</code></td><td><code>%f</code></td><td><code>%f</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong><code>double</code></strong></td><td><strong><code>%lf</code></strong></td><td><strong><code>%f</code></strong></td></tr><tr><td><code>char</code></td><td><code>%c</code></td><td><code>%c</code></td></tr><tr><td>字符串</td><td><code>%s</code></td><td><code>%s</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="⚠️-最容易错的点">⚠️ 最容易错的点</h3><blockquote><p><strong><code>double</code> 在 <code>scanf</code> 里用 <code>%lf</code>，在 <code>printf</code> 里用 <code>%f</code>！</strong></p></blockquote><p><strong>原因</strong>：<code>printf</code> 会把 <code>float</code> 自动提升为 <code>double</code>，所以不用区分；<code>scanf</code> 拿到的是指针，必须区分。</p><h3 id="输出控制格式">输出控制格式</h3><table><thead><tr><th>写法</th><th>效果</th><th>例子（值 3.14159）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>%d</code></td><td>整数</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><code>%f</code></td><td>默认 6 位<strong>小数</strong></td><td><code>3.141590</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>%.3f</code></td><td>3 位小数</td><td><code>3.142</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>%.1f</code></td><td>1 位小数</td><td><code>3.1</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>%g</code></td><td>6 位<strong>有效数字</strong></td><td><code>3.14159</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>%.6g</code></td><td>6 位有效数字</td><td><code>3.14159</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>%02d</code></td><td>宽度 2，不足补 0</td><td><code>08</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>%*c</code></td><td>宽度用变量控制</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="⚠️-小数位数-vs-有效数字">⚠️ 小数位数 vs 有效数字</h3><figure class="highlight cos"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">%f</span>  → 数的是<span class="string">&quot;小数点后几位&quot;</span>    <span class="number">166.666667</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">%g</span>  → 数的是<span class="string">&quot;从第一个非零数字起一共几位&quot;</span>   <span class="number">166.667</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="⚠️-1f-和-lf">⚠️ <code>%.1f</code> 和 <code>%.lf</code></h3><p><strong><code>1</code> 是数字一，<code>l</code> 是小写字母 L</strong> —— 长得太像，极易看错。</p><h3 id="⚠️-尾行换行">⚠️ 尾行换行</h3><p><strong>题目输出最后一行通常不加 <code>\n</code></strong>，多一个都可能 WA。（B2005 就栽在这）</p><hr><h2 id="四、变量与命名规范">四、变量与命名规范</h2><h3 id="命名原则">命名原则</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> total_jiao = a * <span class="number">10</span> + b;   <span class="comment">// ✅ 有意义</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> x;                          <span class="comment">// ⚠️ 太短</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> ttl_Jiao;                   <span class="comment">// ⚠️ 风格混搭</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>C 风格</strong>：全小写 + 下划线（<code>total_jiao</code>）或驼峰（<code>totalJiao</code>），<strong>选一种别混</strong>。</p><h3 id="⚠️-不要用这些名字">⚠️ 不要用这些名字</h3><p><code>cout</code>、<code>cin</code>、<code>endl</code>、<code>string</code>、<code>max</code>、<code>min</code>、<code>count</code>、<code>time</code>、<code>index</code>、<code>y1</code></p><p>（都是 C++ 或标准库的名字，以后会冲突）</p><h3 id="变量作用域">变量作用域</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (t == <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> apple = <span class="number">10</span>;    <span class="comment">// 只在这个 &#123;&#125; 里活着</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">if</span> (t == <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> apple = <span class="number">20</span>;    <span class="comment">// 另一个 apple，不冲突</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong><code>&#123;&#125;</code> 形成作用域，出了 <code>&#123;&#125;</code> 变量就消失了。</strong></p><hr><h2 id="五、运算陷阱">五、运算陷阱</h2><h3 id="⭐-陷阱-1：整数除法（踩过-5-次以上！）">⭐ 陷阱 1：整数除法（踩过 5 次以上！）</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">500</span> / <span class="number">3</span>        <span class="comment">// = 166   整数除法，小数全丢</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">500.0</span> / <span class="number">3</span>      <span class="comment">// = 166.6667  ✅</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">4</span> / <span class="number">3</span>          <span class="comment">// = 1     ❌ 灾难</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">4.0</span> / <span class="number">3.0</span>      <span class="comment">// = 1.333 ✅</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>规则</strong>：<strong>只要算式里有小数，参与运算的数就必须至少有一个是浮点类型。</strong></p><p><strong>三种修法</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">double</span> a = (<span class="type">double</span>)t / n;     <span class="comment">// 强制类型转换</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">double</span> a = t * <span class="number">1.0</span> / n;       <span class="comment">// 乘 1.0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">double</span> a = <span class="number">4.0</span> / <span class="number">3.0</span> * pi;    <span class="comment">// 直接写浮点</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="⭐-陷阱-2：向上取整-向下取整">⭐ 陷阱 2：向上取整 / 向下取整</h3><table><thead><tr><th>场景</th><th>方向</th><th>写法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>至少需要几个（不够也进位）</td><td><strong>向上</strong></td><td><code>(a + b - 1) / b</code></td></tr><tr><td>最多能买几个（不够就舍）</td><td><strong>向下</strong></td><td><code>a / b</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>例</strong>：走路 10 米，速度 3 米/分 → <code>(10 + 3 - 1) / 3 = 4</code> 分钟</p><h3 id="⭐-陷阱-3：浮点数不要用-比较">⭐ 陷阱 3：浮点数不要用 <code>==</code> 比较</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (a == <span class="number">0.1</span> + <span class="number">0.2</span>)     <span class="comment">// ❌ 浮点几乎不可能精确相等</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (a &gt; <span class="number">0.2999</span>)         <span class="comment">// ✅ 用 &gt; 或 &lt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="⭐-陷阱-4：-和-写错">⭐ 陷阱 4：<code>==</code> 和 <code>=</code> 写错</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (t == <span class="number">4</span>)     <span class="comment">// ✅ 比较</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (t = <span class="number">4</span>)      <span class="comment">// ❌ 赋值！条件永真，t 被覆盖</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>编译器可能只给警告，不报错。</strong> 防御写法：<code>if (4 == t)</code>（写错会立刻报错）</p><h3 id="⭐-陷阱-5：数据范围">⭐ 陷阱 5：数据范围</h3><table><thead><tr><th>范围提示</th><th>用什么</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>保证答案在 int 范围内</td><td><code>int</code></td></tr><tr><td>答案可能到 10^18</td><td><code>long long</code></td></tr><tr><td>没说</td><td>自己估算会不会溢出</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><code>int</code> 上限约 21 亿（2.1 × 10⁹）</strong></p><h3 id="陷阱-6：类型不匹配导致输出乱码">陷阱 6：类型不匹配导致输出乱码</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, a * <span class="number">0.2</span> + b * <span class="number">0.3</span>);   <span class="comment">// ❌ 算出来是 double，用 %d 打印 = 乱码</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong><code>printf</code> 完全信任格式符</strong>，类型错了它不知道，会读出垃圾。</p><hr><h2 id="六、逻辑运算符">六、逻辑运算符</h2><table><thead><tr><th>运算符</th><th>读作</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&amp;&amp;</code></td><td>与 AND</td><td>两边都真才真</td></tr><tr><td><code>||</code></td><td>或 OR</td><td>有一个真就真</td></tr><tr><td><code>!</code></td><td>非 NOT</td><td>取反</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="⚠️-别写成单个-或">⚠️ 别写成单个 <code>&amp;</code> 或 <code>|</code></h3><p><strong>单个是位运算</strong>，不是逻辑运算，<strong>写错了不报错但结果全错</strong>。</p><h3 id="短路求值">短路求值</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (i &lt; n &amp;&amp; a[i] &gt; <span class="number">0</span>)    <span class="comment">// 左边假 → 右边不看 → 防越界</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="关系表达式本身是-1-或-0">关系表达式本身是 1 或 0</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> p1 = (x % <span class="number">2</span> == <span class="number">0</span>);       <span class="comment">// p1 是 1 或 0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> p2 = (x &gt; <span class="number">4</span> &amp;&amp; x &lt;= <span class="number">12</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> both = p1 &amp;&amp; p2;         <span class="comment">// 可以直接当数用</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="“刚好一个成立”-异或">“刚好一个成立” = 异或</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> b = (p1 != p2);    <span class="comment">// ✅ 一真一假</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="优先级">优先级</h3><figure class="highlight 1c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">!  &gt;  比较  &gt;  <span class="meta">&amp;&amp;  &gt;  ||</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>不确定就加括号。</strong></p><hr><h2 id="七、常见数学函数">七、常见数学函数</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;math.h&gt;</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th>函数</th><th>作用</th><th>例子</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>sqrt(x)</code></td><td>平方根</td><td><code>sqrt(117.0)</code> → <code>10.8167</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>pow(x, y)</code></td><td>x 的 y 次方</td><td><code>pow(v, 1.0/3.0)</code> 开立方</td></tr><tr><td><code>fabs(x)</code></td><td>浮点绝对值</td><td><code>fabs(-3.5)</code> → <code>3.5</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>ceil(x)</code></td><td>向上取整</td><td><code>ceil(2.1)</code> → <code>3.0</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>floor(x)</code></td><td>向下取整</td><td><code>floor(2.9)</code> → <code>2.0</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>round(x)</code></td><td>四舍五入</td><td><code>round(2.5)</code> → <code>3.0</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="⚠️-abs-和-fabs-不同">⚠️ <code>abs</code> 和 <code>fabs</code> 不同</h3><ul><li><code>abs</code> 在 <code>stdlib.h</code>，处理 <strong>int</strong></li><li><code>fabs</code> 在 <code>math.h</code>，处理 <strong>double</strong></li></ul><h3 id="⚠️-开立方用-pow">⚠️ 开立方用 <code>pow</code></h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">pow</span>(v, <span class="number">1.0</span> / <span class="number">3.0</span>)    <span class="comment">// ✅ 1.0/3.0 必须是浮点！</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">pow</span>(v, <span class="number">1</span> / <span class="number">3</span>)        <span class="comment">// ❌ 1/3 = 0，结果变成 pow(v, 0) = 1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="⚠️-本地-gcc-编译要加-lm">⚠️ 本地 gcc 编译要加 <code>-lm</code></h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">gcc a.c -o a -lm</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>洛谷上不用管。</strong></p><h3 id="⚠️-浮点误差">⚠️ 浮点误差</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="type">int</span>)<span class="built_in">pow</span>(v, <span class="number">1.0</span>/<span class="number">3.0</span>)         <span class="comment">// 可能是 15.9999998 → 得到 15 ❌</span></span><br><span class="line">(<span class="type">int</span>)(<span class="built_in">pow</span>(v, <span class="number">1.0</span>/<span class="number">3.0</span>) + <span class="number">1e-9</span>) <span class="comment">// 加一点点容错 ✅</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="八、字符串基础">八、字符串基础</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">char</span> s[<span class="number">100</span>];              <span class="comment">// 声明一个能装 100 个 char 的数组</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%s&quot;</span>, s);           <span class="comment">// ⚠️ 不加 &amp;，数组名就是地址</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> n = <span class="built_in">strlen</span>(s);        <span class="comment">// 实际长度（需要 &lt;string.h&gt;）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="⚠️-容量-≠-长度">⚠️ 容量 ≠ 长度</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">char</span> s[<span class="number">100086</span>];    <span class="comment">// 容量 100086</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%s&quot;</span>, s);    <span class="comment">// 输入 &quot;hello&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">strlen</span>(s)          <span class="comment">// 长度 5</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>字符串末尾有隐藏的 <code>'\0'</code>，所以 <code>char s[5]</code> 装不下 5 个字母。</strong></p><h3 id="逐字符处理">逐字符处理</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; n; i++)</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%c&quot;</span>, s[i]);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="倒着打印">倒着打印</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = n - <span class="number">1</span>; i &gt;= <span class="number">0</span>; i--)    <span class="comment">// ⚠️ 是 n-1 不是 n</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%c&quot;</span>, s[i]);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="九、代码风格">九、代码风格</h2><h3 id="缩进（Python-感的来源）">缩进（Python 感的来源）</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (a &gt; b)</span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;大&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;小&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>规律</strong></p><ul><li><code>&#123;</code> 跟上一层<strong>对齐</strong>，或独占一行</li><li>每深一层<strong>多 4 个空格</strong></li><li><strong>用空格不用 Tab</strong>（网页 IDE 里 Tab 会错位）</li></ul><h3 id="空行分组-⭐">空行分组 ⭐</h3><p><strong>用空行把&quot;读入 / 计算 / 输出&quot;分成块</strong> —— 这才是看着舒服的关键。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> a, b;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d%d&quot;</span>, &amp;a, &amp;b);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> sum = a + b;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, sum);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="空格规则">空格规则</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a + b);        <span class="comment">// ✅ 逗号后加空格，前面不加</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d%d&quot;</span>, &amp;a, &amp;b);        <span class="comment">// ✅</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span> , a+b);         <span class="comment">// ❌ 逗号前有空格，运算符没空格</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>逗号/分号前面不加空格，后面加一个；运算符两边各一个空格。</strong></p><h3 id="危险运算要放在安全分支里-⭐">危险运算要放在安全分支里 ⭐</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (t == <span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;0&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> eaten = s / t;    <span class="comment">// ✅ 确认 t != 0 才敢除</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>你曾经把 <code>s / t</code> 写在 <code>if</code> 前面 → <code>t = 0</code> 时直接崩。</strong></p><hr><h2 id="十、调试与排错">十、调试与排错</h2><h3 id="⭐-打印调试法">⭐ 打印调试法</h3><p><strong>在代码里临时加 <code>printf</code> 看中间变量</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;读到了: %s\n&quot;</span>, s);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;长度: %d\n&quot;</span>, <span class="built_in">strlen</span>(s));</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;中间结果: %d\n&quot;</span>, eaten);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>调完记得删掉。</strong></p><h3 id="⭐-手工验算法">⭐ 手工验算法</h3><p><strong>写完关键逻辑，用具体数字代进去念一遍</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">apple / child      → <span class="string">&quot;14 除以 4&quot;</span>  → 每人 <span class="number">3</span> 个 ✔️</span><br><span class="line">child / apple      → <span class="string">&quot;4 除以 14&quot;</span>  → <span class="number">0.28</span>，取整 <span class="number">0</span> ❌ 变量放反了</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>这个方法能抓出 90% 的&quot;变量放反&quot;错误。</strong></p><h3 id="自测清单（交之前扫一遍）">自测清单（交之前扫一遍）</h3><table><thead><tr><th>检查</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>1. <code>&amp;</code></strong></td><td><code>scanf</code> 里每个变量都有吗？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2. <code>==</code> vs <code>=</code></strong></td><td>条件里写的是两个等号吗？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3. 拼写</strong></td><td>变量名前后一致？（大小写！<code>lsat</code> vs <code>last</code>）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4. 分号</strong></td><td>每行结尾都有吗？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>5. 括号</strong></td><td>配对吗？数清楚了？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6. 格式符</strong></td><td><code>%d</code> 配 int？<code>%lf</code>/<code>%f</code> 配对了吗？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7. 输入顺序</strong></td><td>和题目的变量顺序一致吗？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8. 尾行换行</strong></td><td>多加 <code>\n</code> 了吗？</td></tr><tr><td><strong>9. <code>return 0</code></strong></td><td>写了吗？</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="边界测试-⭐">边界测试 ⭐</h3><p><strong>别只用样例测，想想极端情况</strong>：</p><ul><li><code>t = 0</code>？（除零）</li><li>结果为负？（要不要归零）</li><li>数据超范围？（溢出）</li><li>空输入 / 单个元素？</li></ul><hr><h2 id="十一、洛谷报错含义">十一、洛谷报错含义</h2><table><thead><tr><th>缩写</th><th>全称</th><th>含义</th><th>常见原因</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>AC</strong></td><td>Accepted</td><td>通过</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><strong>WA</strong></td><td>Wrong Answer</td><td>答案错</td><td>逻辑错、格式错、精度错</td></tr><tr><td><strong>RE</strong></td><td>Runtime Error</td><td>运行崩溃</td><td>漏 <code>&amp;</code>、数组越界、<strong>除以 0</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>TLE</strong></td><td>Time Limit Exceeded</td><td>超时</td><td>算法太慢</td></tr><tr><td><strong>CE</strong></td><td>Compile Error</td><td>编译失败</td><td>语法错误</td></tr><tr><td><strong>MLE</strong></td><td>Memory Limit Exceeded</td><td>内存超限</td><td>数组开太大</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="⭐-关键认知">⭐ 关键认知</h3><blockquote><p><strong>OJ 报的是&quot;最终状态&quot;，不是&quot;bug 清单&quot;。</strong><br><strong>一个 WA 背后可能藏着好几个错误，改完一个还有下一个。</strong></p></blockquote><p><strong>所以修 bug 是循环</strong>：改 → 交 → 看结果 → 改 → 交。</p><h3 id="看报错信息">看报错信息</h3><p><strong>CE 时编译器会告诉你</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight subunit"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">error: </span>&#x27;child&#x27; undeclared; did you mean &#x27;child3&#x27;?</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>直接就是答案。</strong> 越是新手越该认真读报错。</p><p><strong>警告也要看</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight vhdl"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="literal">warning</span>: unused <span class="keyword">variable</span> <span class="symbol">&#x27;child3</span>&#x27;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>“定义了但没用”</strong> —— 常常正好指出你写错了变量名。</p><hr><h2 id="十二、刷题清单">十二、刷题清单</h2><h3 id="【入门1】顺序结构（✅-已完成）">【入门1】顺序结构（✅ 已完成）</h3><table><thead><tr><th>题号</th><th>题目</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>B2002</td><td>Hello, World!</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>B2025</td><td>输出字符菱形</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>P1000</td><td>超级玛丽游戏</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>P1001</td><td>A+B Problem</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>B2005</td><td>字符三角形</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P5703</td><td>苹果采购</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P5704</td><td>字母转换</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>P5705</td><td>数字反转</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P5706</td><td>再分肥宅水</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>P5708</td><td>三角形面积</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P5707</td><td>上学迟到</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>B2029</td><td>大象喝水</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P1425</td><td>小鱼的游泳时间</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P1421</td><td>小玉买文具</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>P3954</td><td>成绩</td><td>✅</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="【入门2】分支结构（🔄-进行中）">【入门2】分支结构（🔄 进行中）</h3><table><thead><tr><th>序号</th><th>题号</th><th>题目</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>P2433</td><td>小学数学 N 合一</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>P5709</td><td>苹果和虫子</td><td>✅</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>P5710</strong></td><td><strong>数的性质</strong></td><td>🔄 <strong>当前</strong></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>P5711</td><td>闰年判断</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>P5712</td><td>Apples</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>P5713</td><td>洛谷团队系统</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>P5714</td><td>肥胖问题</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>P5715</td><td>三位数排序</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>P5716</td><td>月份天数</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>P1085</td><td>不高兴的津津</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>P1909</td><td>买铅笔</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>P5717</td><td>三角形分类</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>P1422</td><td>小玉家的电费</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>P1424</td><td>小鱼的航程</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>P1888</td><td>三角函数</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>P1046</td><td>陶陶摘苹果</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>P4414</td><td>ABC</td><td>⬜</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>P1055</td><td>ISBN 号码</td><td>⬜</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="十三、踩过的坑速查">十三、踩过的坑速查</h2><p><strong>按踩坑顺序排列，每一个都是真实犯过的错。</strong></p><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>题目</th><th>错误</th><th>教训</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>B2005</td><td>输出多了尾行换行</td><td>尾行 <code>\n</code> 会导致 WA</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>P5703</td><td><code>scanf(&quot;%d%d&quot;, x, y)</code> 漏 <code>&amp;</code></td><td>漏 <code>&amp;</code> → RE</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>P5705</td><td>循环写成 <code>i = 3</code>，漏了最大下标</td><td>下标是 <code>0</code> 到 <code>len-1</code></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>P5708</td><td><code>s</code> / <code>S</code> 大小写不一致</td><td>C 大小写敏感</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>P5708</td><td><code>%.lf</code>（字母 l）当成 <code>%.1f</code>（数字 1）</td><td>这俩长得太像</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>P1421</td><td><code>int price = 19</code> 漏分号</td><td>交前扫一眼分号</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>P3954</td><td><code>%d</code> 打印 <code>double</code> 表达式</td><td>类型必须匹配格式符</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>B2029</td><td><code>scanf</code> 又漏 <code>&amp;</code></td><td>第二次踩同一个坑</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>P2433</td><td><code>if (t = 4)</code> 少一个等号</td><td>赋值 vs 比较</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>P2433</td><td><code>child</code> 写成 <code>child3</code> 的错拼</td><td>看编译器警告</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>P2433</td><td><code>4 / 3</code> 整数除法</td><td>球体积少 1.33 倍</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>P2433</td><td><code>cout</code> 输出精度 ≠ <code>printf(&quot;%f&quot;)</code></td><td><code>cout</code> 相当于 <code>%g</code></td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>P2433</td><td><code>child / apple</code> 变量放反</td><td>用&quot;念一遍&quot;法自查</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>P5709</td><td><code>scanf</code> 顺序写成 <code>m s t</code>（题目是 <code>m t s</code>）</td><td>顺序必须对齐题面</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>P5709</td><td><code>s / t</code> 写在 <code>if (t == 0)</code> 之前</td><td>危险运算要放安全分支里</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>P5709</td><td>变量名打错 <code>lsat</code></td><td>警告&quot;未使用变量&quot;是线索</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>P5709</td><td><strong>忘了&quot;正在吃的苹果&quot;也要减</strong></td><td>读题注意定语&quot;完整的&quot;</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="十四、常用套路总结">十四、常用套路总结</h2><h3 id="套路-1：统一单位">套路 1：统一单位</h3><p><strong>时间/钱/长度加减，先统一到最小单位，算完再换回来。</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> start = a * <span class="number">60</span> + b;      <span class="comment">// 小时分 → 分钟</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> total = end - start;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d %d&quot;</span>, total / <span class="number">60</span>, total % <span class="number">60</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>好处</strong>：避免&quot;借位&quot;的麻烦。</p><h3 id="套路-2：桶计数（数组当下标）">套路 2：桶计数（数组当下标）</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> ct[<span class="number">26</span>] = &#123;<span class="number">0</span>&#125;;                <span class="comment">// 计数数组，一定初始化</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; n; i++)</span><br><span class="line">    ct[s[i] - <span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>]++;            <span class="comment">// 字符 → 下标</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>把 26 个 <code>if</code> 变成一行。</strong></p><h3 id="套路-3：字符-↔-数字">套路 3：字符 ↔ 数字</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">s[i] - <span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>      <span class="comment">// 字符 → 下标</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span> + c         <span class="comment">// 下标 → 字符</span></span><br><span class="line">c - <span class="number">32</span>          <span class="comment">// 小写 → 大写（只对纯小写安全）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">toupper</span>(c)      <span class="comment">// 更安全的转换（需要 &lt;ctype.h&gt;）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="套路-4：倒推">套路 4：倒推</h3><p><strong>“经过一系列操作到达某个状态，问初始状态” → 从已知终点倒着推。</strong></p><p><strong>逆向运算</strong>：加变减、减变加、乘变除、除变乘，<strong>顺序也要倒过来</strong>。</p><p><strong>例子（猴子吃桃）</strong>：正向是 <code>÷2 - 1</code>，逆向就是 <code>+1 ×2</code>。</p><h3 id="套路-5：把数学式翻译成-C">套路 5：把数学式翻译成 C</h3><p><strong>老老实实按运算符优先级加括号</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// √(p(p-a)(p-b)(p-c))</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">double</span> s = <span class="built_in">sqrt</span>(p * (p - a) * (p - b) * (p - c));</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>⚠️ 根号罩住的范围，括号必须全部包住。</strong></p><hr><h2 id="十五、下一步计划">十五、下一步计划</h2><ul><li>[ ] 完成 P5710 数的性质</li><li>[ ] 刷完【入门2】剩余 16 题</li><li>[ ] 补做【入门1】漏掉的 B2002、B2025、P1000、P5704、P5706</li><li>[ ] 进【入门3】循环结构</li><li>[ ] 进【入门4】数组</li><li>[ ] 进【入门5】字符串</li><li>[ ] 进【入门6】函数与结构体</li></ul><hr><h2 id="十六、还没学到但会遇到的东西">十六、还没学到但会遇到的东西</h2><p><strong>先混个眼熟，用到再学：</strong></p><ul><li><strong>数组</strong>：<code>int a[100];</code> 存一批数据</li><li><strong>循环嵌套</strong>：两层 <code>for</code> 处理二维问题</li><li><strong>函数</strong>：把重复代码抽出来</li><li><strong>结构体</strong>：把相关数据打包</li><li><strong>排序</strong>：<code>qsort</code> 或手写</li><li><strong>数学算法</strong>：GCD（欧几里得）、质数筛、快速幂 —— <strong>模板固定，背下来就行</strong></li></ul><p><strong>⭐ 别提前焦虑，用到时再学最快。</strong></p><hr><p><em>笔记整理自洛谷【入门1】【入门2】刷题过程</em><br><em>最后更新：P5709 AC 之后</em></p>]]></content>
      
      
